    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sits on the western shore of Lake Wisconsin, just south of the scenic Wisconsin River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.prairiedusac.net/about-prairie-du-sac"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1914, the Prairie du Sac Dam was completed north of town, creating Lake Wisconsin and reshaping the river valley.",
